      "writtenOn": "2026-06-22T17:43:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a potential integer overflow here because `os2_loc-\u003eoffset` and `os2_loc-\u003esize` are both `uint32_t`. If their sum exceeds `UINT32_MAX`, it will wrap around to a small value, bypassing the `filesize` check.\n\nConsider rewriting this to avoid overflow:\n```cpp\nif (os2_loc \u0026\u0026 os2_loc-\u003esize \u003c\u003d filesize \u0026\u0026 os2_loc-\u003eoffset \u003c\u003d filesize - os2_loc-\u003esize) {\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 242,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 242,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "3840e859ede8670370eafa220978f414cc5a39d2",
